    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Embark on an exciting journey of language and culture exploration with our Bachelor of Languages. Immerse yourself in global languages and cultures, develop high-level intercultural skills. No matter your level, our program offers tailored pathways. Join us and become a global communicator.</p> <p>Designed for students who don’t want to be constrained by geographic location in their careers. With more and more businesses operating across international boundaries, graduates who can speak multiple languages and demonstrate a high level of cultural competence, are especially sought-after.</p>',
