    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Explore your passions across business and the arts by combining our highly regarded Arts and Commerce degrees for a well-rounded education. You''ll also gain essential business skills for navigating the intersection of the arts and business sectors.</p> <p>For those looking to immerse themselves in great minds and ideas, while gaining insights into business operations and analytics, this degree is for you. Delve into literature analysis or master business strategies in our program, which equips you with skills to thrive in diverse career paths. </p>',
