    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Our combined Bachelor of Science and Bachelor of Arts gives you the opportunity to pursue diverse disciplines, broaden your knowledge and skills, or make niche choices for highly specialised industries and careers.</p> <p>This combined degree offers exceptional opportunities to budding scientists who relish a challenge. From lectures to independent research and in-depth problem solving, our combined degree will give you the skills to embark on a rewarding career.</p>',
