UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The Bachelor of Engineering Honours and Bachelor of Science (Medical Science) will develop your engineering expertise and provide an essential foundation in the structure of the human body, from molecules through to whole systems.</p> <p>You can choose from one of two streams. Studying the Biomedical Engineering stream will enable you to contribute to innovative discoveries within biology and medicine, while the Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering stream will allow you to use your learning in cells and bioprocessing to make the latest vaccines and therapeutic proteins.</p>',
