    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Gain expertise, skills and experience in a growing field which underpins our society. By combining technical knowledge, real-world experience and problem-solving skills, you''ll graduate ready to operate as a computer scientist and develop innovative solutions that address technological challenges.</p> <p>This degree suits those with a computing qualification who are looking to build on their experience to specialise in computer science and advance their career in a future-focused field. </p> <p>As an alternative, the <a href="/content/courses/courses/pc/master-of-computer-science.html">Master of Computer Science</a> is available for those with no prior computing experience. </p>',
