    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The Bachelor of Animal and Veterinary Bioscience provides a broad overview of both domestic animals and wildlife species and their environment, and knowledge in fields such as applied animal biotechnologies, reproduction and nutrition.</p> <p>Study animal behaviour and management systems that respect ethical and environmental concerns and promote animal welfare. For students interested in gaining fundamental and applied knowledge in animal bioscience and those seeking the opportunity to build a career in a wide variety of veterinary and animal science industries.</p>',
