    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The Bachelor of International Studies (Honours) is a one-year full-time program that develops research skills in International Studies through a substantial, original project. Designed for those interested in languages, cultures, global politics, and history, it equips you with interdisciplinary expertise to understand and address international issues effectively.</p> <p>The course is designed to prepare high-achieving <a href="/content/courses/courses/uc/bachelor-of-international-studies.html">Bachelor of International Studies</a> (or equivalent) graduates for higher degree by research (eg. PhD) studies. </p>',
