inimum result of 6.5 overall and a minimum result of 6.0 in each band</li><li>Pearsons Test of English: A minimum result of 64 overall and a minimum result of 60 in each band</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>',
    apply_form = 'https://www.sydney.edu.au/courses/courses/uc/bachelor-of-engineering-honours-mechanical-engineering2.html',
