    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p><strong><em>In response to COVID-19, the University of Sydney has reviewed the availability of courses to be delivered remotely. </em></strong></p> <p><em>This course will be available for students to study remotely during 2022 if they are unable to undertake face-to-face study. Please note that some units of study that are not essential to completing the degree may not be available to be studied remotely. For the latest updates on course availability, visit the </em><a href="https://www.sydney.edu.au/covid-19/students/study-information.html"><em>COVID-19 information page</em></a><em>. </em></p> <p><strong>About this course</strong></p> <h4>Structure</h4><p>This program includes foundational core units, advanced core units and electives you can take with different faculties.</p> <p><a href="https://sydney.edu.au/content/dam/corporate/documents/sydney-school-of-architecture-design-and-planning/study/master-of-design/Graduate%20Diploma%20.pdf">Download an indicative course progression table for the Graduate Diploma in Design.</a></p>',
